r licensed massage therapist and provide clients\nwith the best care available.\n\nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew Bill\n\nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State\n\nEFFECTIVE DATE:\n\n\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n\n",
